  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The five fire chains are just about to coil around a one finger flow shark when time in the area around the shark slows to an extreme. As a time path desolate beast it is less restricted. It sways through tiny gaps, gets past the chains, and pierces Blazing Heaven Demoness’s forehead, then her chest. She later judges that the shark used a time path Immortal Gu to slow time both when it collided with her small fire bird and when it dodged these chains.",
